            "review_text": "Tyolatravels\n1 contribution\n0\nTerrible food\nMay 2015 • Family\nMy boyfriend and I ordered roasted pork and the soya sauce chicken as recommended by staff and it was very average for the price. About $30 USD for the chicken and it was all bones and grit so we sent it back. Beautiful atmosphere but only ones in a restaurant that could fit at least 500 people. Staff were very apologetic and helpful however food was just not up to standard.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 14, 2015",
