            "review_title": "Review at Silk 99 Saigon",
            "review_text": "Hien N\n2 contributions\n0\nOne of the very good restaurant to enjoy\nDec 2014 • Solo\nAlthough that was the first time i came there but it made me very impressed for it's space and food. With a very luxury but warm atmosphere, it made me feel very comfortable to relax. Moreover, its special food was also unforgettable and was served fastly (I have heard someone complained about the serving time but in my opinion the service is good). That's all i want to comment about this place, you all should try one time and i do believe that you will think like i do.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 9, 2015",
