            "review_title": "Review at Silk 99 Saigon",
            "review_text": "Howard C\nHong Kong, China2 contributions\n0\nA beautiful place to dine and chill out.\nDec 2014 • Friends\nLast day of the year 2014, a group of friends and I went to the restaurant. The facade of the restaurant looks like a trendy club. We were greeted and the entrance and guided through a pretty spacious lobby bar to enter the main restaurant floor. The design is beautiful, it has many different sections. The food came out at a moderate time. The food presentation is nice, looks artful. We order some BBQ combo, a fried lobster, steamed fish and green fried rice. Food is very good. Nothing to complaint. It was packed for the night, since it was New Year's Eve, but the food came out on time. They even had some live band played and DJ performed. Definitely come back on my next visit.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 4, 2015",
