            "review_title": "Review at Silk 99 Saigon",
            "review_text": "Le H\n4 contributions\n1\nNeed more improvement\nNov 2014 • Friends\nDecoration is nice but need a lot of improvement:\n1. Order a set menu including some pcs of Dim Sum for starter, beef soup, vegetable, rice with char siu pork for main course, then 2 pcs of fruit and 2 pcs of cake for desert. However, food is cold and served in a wrong order. I was offered fruit and cake first, then followed by the beef soup!\n2. Took long time to wait for the next dish. Finished the first dish and need to wait nearly 15min for the next one. However, the next table is totally different! Food is non-stop coming!\n3. The list of dish is placed on the table. Staff should check and tick when they serve the food to make sure food are served enough. But it seems that they didnt. They asked me if this dish or that dish is served yet?!?!\n\nI was told that this is just a soft opening only, so just few comments and hope management will consider and change to be ready for the grand opening.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 30, 2014",
