            "review_text": "kennedymak\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nGreat place, nice food but staff need to be trained more\nNov 2014 • Couples\nFirst time came with my gf for dinner, the place look so luxury with an great view inside. Food and price is worth it but just noted for staff, some of the staff need learn more english cause when i order food using english (i am indonesian), she keep replying me using vietnamese and chinese language even i told her can speak little bit chinese ony, at least she must call someone can speak english talk so i can ask about menu inside also. :)\nBut overall, recomanded place!\n(sorry no photo review cause once the food came,i didnt have time take photo already)\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 27, 2014",
